rget":"当你走进洞穴时，你发现这里已经被魔法力量扭曲了，使地形形成尖锐的棱角和弯折。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3b2853df343fed290fcd0278cb7e0cc85109ec3c779e6c8849c60e784d7fe511","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"402280fd48e15b9181f258ade33a2cc4857b6e48590a1155a60dcaad9c32247a","logical_entry_identity":"e5d6f2b62d06d473a2689137881053375f27a981428094e2ed10ae8de3c1d1ee","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Sends out a surge of undeath energies into your aura.\n\t\tAll minions inside gain 25%% speed for %d turns\n\t\tAll non-ghoul minions are healed by %d%%.\n\t\tIf you know Call of the Mausoleum, the time remaining to the next free ghoul is reduced by %d.\n\t\tif you know Corpse Explosion or Putrescent Liquefaction the duration of those effects are increased by %d.\n\t\tAll non-undead foes caught inside are dazed for %d turns.\n\t\tIn addition all your minions (created after you learn this spell) have a passive health regeneration.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"在你的光环中放出一股不死能量。\n\t\t范围内所有随从获得 25%% 速度，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t所有非食尸鬼的随从被治疗 %d%%。\n\t\t如果你掌握陵墓召唤技能，到下一个免费食尸鬼的时间降低 %d。\n\t\t如果你掌握夺命尸爆或腐烂液化技能，这些效果的持续时间延长 %d。\n\t\t范围内所有非不死生物的敌人都会被茫然 %d 回合。\n\t\t此外，你的所有随从（在学会该法术后制造的）获得额外被动生命回复。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"446383224d17447c1424c308d7903a018e6640bc32dec0bf3d88553e0c8b6ecc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4947e4216f1c54fd6c8f3f3aa5984e50f96ff5e6bb4445ad4c37dfc7fa284aa8","logical_entry_identity":"2cc21469be1d803fa020204ad7b0fb062d16ee36ebeea647eb7cde6a94135743","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"attack everything in a line out to range %d, dealing 100%% weapon damage (as light), and healing for 50%% of the damage dealt","source_tag":"tformat","target":"攻击长度为 %d 的直线上所有目标，造成 100%% 光系武器伤害，并将 50%% 伤害转化为治疗。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d6c6bd54753838803123ac309474442d31e2c6a91403b8fc9010012502158c7a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4b2df7b235df959773c2ef3a5ddc3065c90de0b2f7be28a42debcdcfebaf60b8","logical_entry_identity":"7274c6495a83e12a